# The contact-aided right-invariant EKF of Hartley, Ghaffari, Eustice and
# Grizzle, IJRR 2020, sec. 5: one contact, no biases, discretised as its
# appendix A. X_n is the paper's X-bar at t_n, in SE_3(3) (sec. 5.1), its
# blocks R, v, p and d. The inputs are 21 steps of a simulated walk, its IMU
# and kinematics noisy. An independent NumPy filter on them, by scipy's expm
# for (66) and (54), gives at n = 20 p = [0.111011445; 0.0251916243;
# 0.488289301] and tr P = 0.0727932965.

